  # ==================== 2026-05-14 热区扩展：新发现赏金仓库 ====================
  # 来源: gh search issues, Algora challenges, GitHub API 搜索

  # Claude Builders Bounty - Claude Code 技能/钩子/代理赏金社区 ★★★★★
  - repo: claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty
    language: typescript
    labels: ["bounty"]
    bounty_source: "github-sponsors"
    expected_bounty_range: [50, 200]
    tags: ["active", "ai-agent", "low-competition"]
    notes: "Claude Code 社区赏金板。现有5个开放赏金：SKILL($50)、TEMPLATE($75)、HOOK($100)、AGENT($150)、WORKFLOW($200)。所有任务均为 AI 代理友好型 TypeScript/Claude Code 配置任务。极低竞争。2026-05-14 新发现。"

  # TSPerf Tracer - TypeScript 类型复杂度 VSCode 扩展 (Algora Challenge)
  - repo: tsperf/tracer
    language: typescript
    labels: ["bounty", "help wanted"]
    bounty_source: "algora"
    expected_bounty_range: [500, 5000]
    tags: ["algora", "active", "low-competition"]
    notes: "Algora Challenge 赏金。VSCode 扩展测量 TypeScript 类型复杂度。TypeScript 项目（178 stars）。Algora 平台免 KYC。2026-05-14 新发现。"

